			"notes": "## 1.3.5\n\nFix client-server crash (duplicate IDs)\n\n## 1.3.4\n\nFix recipe stuff\n\n## 1.3.3\n\nFix model problems\n\n## 1.3.1\n\n- Evaluate contents by slot: For first slot, either filter or move; if nothing, then for second slot, either filter or move\n- Allow an 'e' in the matches boxes\n- Fix problems working with Lithium\n\n## 1.3\n\n- Don't pull items from a filter or hopper above\n- Fix several missing text items\n\n## 1.2.2\n\nFix up the screen so placement of the \"top\" diagram is better\n\n## 1.2\n\nPut slots in the filter itself for examples\n\n## 1.1\n\nUse accessWidener to get access instead of reflection"
